# Private keys/containers; public certificate/public-key PEM source stays allowed.
# Filename rules cannot detect private-key contents under arbitrary other names.
**/*.[kK][eE][yY]
**/*.[pP]12
**/*.[pP][fF][xX]
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_dsa
**/id_*.[pP][eE][mM]
